WMT (wmt_drv, OPPO MT6765 common/) on Linux 5.10, applied to the staged tree by
tools/prepare-connectivity-sources.py (patches.applied in connectivity-sources.json).

- ioremap_nocache to ioremap (the same mapping on arm64).
- struct timeval to struct __kernel_old_timeval, rtc_time_to_tm to rtc_time64_to_tm.
- procfs file_operations to proc_ops.
- stp_uart: 5.10 tty ldisc read signature, drop MIN/MAX that clash with the kernel's.
- (void) on prototypes for -Wstrict-prototypes.
- OPPO-only code out, as stock: the oppo_project.h include and get_eng_version()
  check in wmt_dev.c (stock always asserts on high temperature) and the
  oplus_rpmh_stats_statics() calls in mtk_wcn_consys_hw.c (stock imports neither).

